0	section	Starting off
0	section	If the player has not visited Great Kourend before
1	line	Veos	Hello there.
1	option	Who are you?
2	line	Player	Who are you?
2	line	Veos	The name's Veos. I'm a treasure hunter from the wonderous Kingdom of Great Kourend.
2	line	Player	Great Kourend? Where's that?
2	line	Veos	Across the sea to the far west. It is a truly magnificent place.
2	line	Player	Interesting. So what brings you to Lumbridge?
2	line	Veos	I'm here on a bit of a hunt. The hunt for treasure. Back in my home of Great Kourend, I came across a scroll. I believe it will lead me to something of great value.
2	line	Veos	Alas, I've hit a bit of a blocker. The scroll has led me here but as I don't really know the area, I'm not sure what to do next.
2	option	Can I help?
3	line	Veos	Hmmm. Maybe you can. You probably know this area better than I do. You might be able to work the scroll out. I'll be able to reward you if you help.
3	option	Sounds good, what should I do?
4	line	Player	Sounds good, what should I do?
4	cond	If the player does not have any free inventory space:
5	line	Veos	First you should go and make some room in your inventory. Once you've done that, you can have a look at this scroll.
5	action	end
4	cond	If the player has a free inventory space:
5	line	Veos	Take this scroll. It should lead you to the treasure I seek. Once you've found it, meet me at my ship. It's docked at the northernmost pier in Port Sarim.
5	action	
5	line	Player	Awesome. Anything else I should know?
5	line	Veos	You'll probably want a spade, I find they're pretty much always needed when it comes to hunting treasure. Check the general store if you don't have one. If you need any extra help, just let me know.
5	line	Player	Okay, thanks Veos.
5	line	Veos	Good luck.
5	action	end
3	option	I'm good thanks.
4	line	Player	I'm good thanks.
4	line	Veos	Fair enough. I'll be here if you change your mind.
4	action	end
2	option	Well good luck with it.
