1	line	Veos	Brilliant. This is just what I was looking for. Thank you so much for your help.
1	line	Player	No problem. So what is this treasure anyway?
1	line	Veos	Oh err... nothing important. Just something that might be of use to me back in Great Kourend.
1	line	Player	If you say so...
1	line	Veos	Anyway, as promised, a reward for you.
1	line	Veos	Anyway, I'd best be getting back to Great Kourend. I'm sure I'll be back here before long though, there's always more treasure to be found.
